2", "resolution": "1080x1920"}], "comments": [{"author": "vedanth_kamath", "author_id": "7317279239", "id": "18119038928321308", "text": "Wrong, it's the balmunis cursed gatekeepers of Vishnu and vishnu hinself", "timestamp": 1793516271, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "valmiki_vishnu_777", "author_id": "51441569693", "id": "18131274574840867", "text": "My I'd name", "timestamp": 1793376197, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "kvishnu_kv", "author_id": "33410763424", "id": "17913701358492375", "text": "Vishnu", "timestamp": 1793255023, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "aditthh.__", "author_id": "45178812952", "id": "17994236460023106", "text": "@___sooryanarayanan___", "timestamp": 1792918059, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "rahulbeenup", "author_id": "55393732587", "id": "18483560068114308", "text": "don't powerscale hindu mythology guys! people in the comments i swear. Everything is a leela and is planned by the god. Even a god can be cursed if he allows it!", "timestamp": 1792821414, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "thisisnarayanan", "author_id": "47288855084", "id": "17979328268914710", "text": "Well, hello there :)", "timestamp": 1792783447, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "amu_pdxns", "author_id": "3427936018", "id": "18002646302809870", "text": "Love  the sound design and effects ☺️😀", "timestamp": 1792556565, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "apurbamondal7207", "author_id": "78123663733", "id": "18086877422703458", "text": "Family", "timestamp": 1792507668, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "_abhimanyu__1", "author_id": "3859760899", "id": "17873798631601589", "text": "Good one. Small change - According to shiva puraana, Lord Shiva’s divine influence protected Sage Narada while he was performing tapas. This is because, Lord Shiva had previously performed intense penance at that very location. When Kamadeva tried to disturb Shiva’s meditation, Shiva burned him to ashes. Later, Shiva restored Kamadeva to life but declared that his influence would not work within the area surrounding that place.", "timestamp": 1792481270, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "immaingga", "author_id": "72609893271", "id": "18373975849215962", "text": "Was Lord Ram also a 'Rup' of Vishnu? (I'm sorry Idk what to call rup in english 😭)", "timestamp": 1792464035, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "h._gentle", "author_id": "29611637565", "id": "18083172020338821", "text": "😂🙌", "timestamp": 1792423212, "like_count": 0}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/Deo0BU_xNwU/", "webpage_url_basename": "Deo0BU_xNwU", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "thumbnail": "https://instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-15/856640035_18126877864755882_1559534435396900769_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ig_cache_key=NDAxMDY4NDI1Nzg1NjE4MzMxNg%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjEwODAuc2RyLnZpZGVvX2RlZmF1bHRfY292ZXJfZnJhbWUuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=apfIGMOXLrkQ7kNvwHgXRGe&_nc_oc=Ado5PQj0eeB2ZF_pgzydsmDr9_YPm3rwHW5XTBvMbCd9tdSHaIE4RW3RWObJU9WmRmbTv-iOepA2EKFK-OEp57e0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-2.fna&_nc_gid=ocIkDuWxJ3HSpw6Al3ecIw&_nc_ss=70689&oh=00_AQQvbWAYbjrdaHMkeA5EWYRuYw3ydpYV4vsowA3jcLlDHg&oe=6AF81452", "display_id": "Deo0BU_xNwU", "fulltitle": "Video by therishikatha", "upload_date": "20261018", "epoch": 1794259287, "format": "dash-2165316711032605v - 1080x1920 (DASH video)+dash-2165316031032673a - audio only (DASH audio)", "format_id": "dash-2165316711032605v+dash-2165316031032673a", "ext": "mp4", "protocol": "https+https", "format_note": "DASH video+DASH audio", "tbr": 3553.971, "width": 1080, "height": 1920, "resolution": "1080x1920", "dynamic_range": "SDR", "vcodec": "vp09.00.40.08.00.02.02.05.00", "vbr": 3498.952, "aspect_ratio": 0.56, "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "abr": 55.019, "asr": 48000, "_type": "video", "_version": {"version": "2026.10.26", "release_git_head": "c91f8de0bfb3577894abad716eaaa01659e6bd14", "repository": "yt-dlp/yt-dlp"}}